<title>USA: Delta and Pine sets 4-for-3 stock split.</title>
<headline>Delta and Pine sets 4-for-3 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTT, Miss. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta and Pine Land Co said on Thursday it set a 4-for-3 stock split that will increase the number of outstanding shares to 29 million from 22 million.</p>
<p>The company said it will maintain its quarterly dividend at $0.03 per share after the split, in effect increasing it by 33 percent.</p>
<p>The split is to be distributed on April 11 to holders of record as of March 31.</p>
<p>Delta and Pine makes cotton planting seed.</p>
